+Animation Timeline (400ms):
+├─ Frame 1-24: Pure compositor animation (green)
+├─ Layout recalculations: 0
+├─ Paint operations: Minimal (arrow fade only)
+├─ JavaScript execution: ~5ms total
+└─ Frame rate: Locked 60fps
+```
+
